        "mission_intent": "We need the engagement team to develop a comprehensive risk assessment workpaper covering all financial relationships and transactions between the company and its executive officers, consistent with our obligations under AS 2110, ahead of the interim fieldwork deadline next Friday. The workpaper should document our reading and analysis of all employment and compensation contracts for current executive officers, all proxy statement disclosures, and any other relevant SEC or regulatory filings related to executive compensation arrangements including perquisites and side agreements. Beyond these minimum procedures, I'd also like the team to use best professional judgment to identify any additional procedures that would be appropriate given the company's specific circumstances \u2014 please ensure these supplemental procedures are \"exhaustive and complete\" so that we can demonstrate we've left no stone unturned. The workpaper should map each identified financial relationship or transaction to specific risks of material misstatement at both the financial statement and assertion levels. Given that the client just disclosed two new executive employment agreements late yesterday that include complex multi-year clawback and deferred compensation provisions, please incorporate full analysis of those as well, all while still meeting the Friday deadline.",
